    body: '글의 흐름으로 보아, 주어진 문장이 들어가기에 가장 적절한 곳은?<div class="bogi">From then on, the outcome is effectively locked in, and the quality of the competing products may matter far less than their timing.</div><div class="passage">For most products, the value to a buyer has nothing to do with how many other people own one; a good loaf of bread tastes the same whether one person or a million buy it. ( ① ) Some products, however, become more valuable as more people use them. ( ② ) A telephone is useless if no one else has one, and a messaging app is worth joining mainly because one’s friends are already on it. ( ③ ) For such products, early growth matters enormously. ( ④ ) A product that gains a modest lead in users becomes more attractive to the next wave of buyers, who in turn make it more attractive still, until at some point its rivals can no longer catch up. ( ⑤ ) A technically superior competitor that arrives late may fail simply because everyone it hopes to attract is already elsewhere.</div>',
