    body: '다음 빈칸에 들어갈 말로 가장 적절한 것은?<div class="passage">A translator who replaces each word of the original with its closest equivalent in the new language may seem to be the most faithful of all. Yet such a translation often misleads. A joke translated word for word is no longer funny; a polite expression rendered literally may sound cold or even rude; a line of poetry loses the rhythm that gave it force. What readers of the original experienced — laughter, warmth, a sense of music — does not survive the journey intact. For this reason, skilled translators frequently ________. They may replace a pun with a different pun, or turn a formal phrase into a casual one, so that the new reader reacts as the original reader did. Their loyalty is not to the surface of the text but to what the text does.</div>',
